shu-077","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao","source_id":"s-jinshu-077-yinhao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001","quote":"殷浩，字深源，陳郡長平人也。父羨，字洪喬，為豫章太守，都下人士因其致書者百餘函，行次石頭，皆投之水中，曰：「沈者自沈，浮者自浮，殷洪喬不為致書郵。」其資性介立如此。終於光祿勳。","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"父羨"},"subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001:m0015"}],"interpretation_note":"明父，不補生母；浩及涓ID接羨另獨立退休包。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-jin077-f51-026","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w","title":null,"surname":"殷","ming":"羨","additional_names":["字洪喬"],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001:m0015","quote":"殷浩，字深源，陳郡長平人也。父羨，字洪喬，為豫章太守，都下人士因其致書者百餘函，行次石頭，皆投之水中，曰：「沈者自沈，浮者自浮，殷洪喬不為致書郵。」其資性介立如此。終於光祿勳。","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p001","start":14,"end":20,"surface":"父羨，字洪喬"},"note":"父羨字洪喬且自稱殷洪喬，依同段同人橋記姓殷，不是由子姓泛推。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"zi":"洪喬","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-077","source_id":"s-jinshu-077-yinhao"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-jin077-f51-007","person_id":"djo_u3b_i9w","event_type":"death","source_term":"遭父憂","date_expression":null,"status":"source_attested","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p005","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"遭父憂"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-077","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao","source_id":"s-jinshu-077-yinhao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-077-yinhao:p005","quote":"時桓溫既滅蜀，威勢轉振，朝廷憚之。簡文以浩有盛名，朝野推伏，故引為心膂，以抗于溫，於是與溫頗相疑貳。會遭父憂，去職，時以蔡謨攝揚州，以俟浩，服闋，徵為尚書僕射，不拜。復為建武將軍、揚州刺史，遂參綜朝權。潁川荀羨少有令聞，浩擢為義興、吳郡，以為羽翼。王羲之密說浩、羨，令與桓溫和同，不宜內構嫌隙，浩不從。","person_mention_i